# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-heartbeat
name: Heartbeat
polarity: positive
levels: true
max: 3
# [Solo]: its levels are not added between Transformations used together - the highest of them.
solo: true
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: rule
# Its Transformation's own: it does nothing to the character in general - shown on its row, not among the Active Aspects (the user's).
bar: false
# The rule as read on 2026-11-12, in short; its own words (`text:`) to come from the user.
summary: >
  If your Stress Bonus is at least its Stress Test Requirement - 4 you may enter it for the duration of any Maneuver you use or that targets you; uses per Round equal its level.

---

# Nothing it does by itself yet: the Transformation Maneuver and Mastery read it.
